<title>FRANCE: Gan rises on EU injection news.</title>
<headline>Gan rises on EU injection news.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in France's GAN rose after an UE official said the European Commission was set to approve a French state capital injection of 2.86 billion into the state-controlled insurer at its weekly meeting on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>GAN was up two francs to 118 francs in a volume of 19,425 shares at 1236 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
